---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/IssaLayout.astro";
import "../../styles/shop.css";
---

<SiteLayout title="Fukamushi Genmaicha | Issa Green" description="Fukamushi Genmaicha | Issa Green">
<section class="pdp">
    <div class="section-wrap">
      <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>›</span><a href="/shop-tea">Tea</a><span>›</span><span aria-current="page">Fukamushi Genmaicha</span></nav>
      <div class="pdp-grid">
        <div class="pdp-gallery">
          <div class="pdp-main"><img id="pdp-main" src="/images/shop/fukamushi-genmaicha-80g.jpg" alt="Fukamushi Genmaicha"></div>
          <div class="pdp-thumbs" id="pdp-thumbs"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="pdp-info">
          <div class="pdp-ribbons"><span class="pdp-ribbon">Best seller</span></div>
          <h1>Fukamushi Genmaicha</h1>
          <p class="pdp-sub">Genmaicha · Sugimoto farm · Shizuoka</p>
          <div class="pdp-price" id="pdp-price" aria-live="polite"></div>
          <div class="pdp-opt" id="pdp-opt"></div>
          <div class="pdp-buy">
            <div class="qty" role="group" aria-label="Quantity"><button type="button" id="q-dec" aria-label="Decrease quantity">−</button><output id="q-out" aria-live="polite">1</output><button type="button" id="q-inc" aria-label="Increase quantity">+</button></div>
            <button class="pdp-add" id="pdp-add" type="button"></button>
          </div>
          <p class="pdp-msg" id="pdp-msg" role="alert" hidden></p>
          <p class="pdp-note">Shipping and taxes calculated at checkout. <a href="/shipping">Shipping &amp; returns</a></p>
          <p class="pdp-lead">This is ISSA GREEN&#x27;s most popular tea. Made from fukamushi sencha and brown rice, both grown by the same organic farmer. This variety softens the bitterness of green tea with its unique crispy flavor.</p>
          <div class="pdp-tags"><span class="pdp-tag t0">Diet</span><span class="pdp-tag t1">Low caffeine</span><span class="pdp-tag t2">Crispy flavor</span></div>
          <div class="acc-list"><div class="acc"><button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="acc0">About this tea<span aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="acc-panel" id="acc0" role="region"><div class="acc-in"><p>The sweetness and starch from the popped brown rice have a filling quality that helps avoid overeating — making genmaicha perfect for meals and snacks. Zero calorie drink. Fukamushi genmaicha contains less caffeine compared to regular sencha.</p></div></div></div><div class="acc"><button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="acc1">How to brew<span aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="acc-panel" id="acc1" role="region"><div class="acc-in"><p>1 tsp / 250–500 ml. Hot: 80°C · 1 min. Cold brew: 2–4 hours or overnight.</p></div></div></div><div class="acc"><button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="acc2">Product details<span aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="acc-panel" id="acc2" role="region"><div class="acc-in"><p><strong>Ingredients</strong> Organic green tea, brown rice</p><p><strong>Producer</strong> Sugimoto farm</p><p><strong>Available</strong> Loose tea 80g, Tea bags</p></div></div></div><div class="acc"><button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="acc3">Shipping info<span aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="acc-panel" id="acc3" role="region"><div class="acc-in"><p><strong>Calgary</strong> Within Calgary city limit: $7 flat rate. Free delivery over $75.</p><p><strong>Rest of Canada</strong> $12 flat rate shipping by Canada Post or courier service. Free shipping over $150.</p><p>If you prefer another shipping method, please do not hesitate to contact us. We will arrange a special shipment.</p></div></div></div><div class="acc"><button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="acc4">Return &amp; refund policy<span aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="acc-panel" id="acc4" role="region"><div class="acc-in"><p><strong>Tea</strong> Due to the character of our products, we cannot accept returns or refunds of packaged tea and food.</p><p><strong>Tea ware &amp; goods</strong> We accept returns and issue a gift card for the same amount as the purchased goods. Customers pay the postage for returns.</p><p>Please inform us about defects immediately by email at <a href="mailto:issagreentea@gmail.com">issagreentea@gmail.com</a>. We will make an exchange as soon as possible.</p><p>Most of our products are handcrafted and have unique characters. We are happy to tell you the exact condition of each item before shipping. Please leave the request on the checkout page.</p></div></div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="pdp-rel"><div class="section-wrap"><p class="section-label">More tea</p><div class="rel-grid"><a class="rel-card" href="/products/fukamushi-sencha"><span class="rel-img"><img src="/images/shop/fukamushi-sencha-bags.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="rel-name">Fukamushi sencha</span><span class="rel-price">From $22.00</span></a><a class="rel-card" href="/products/premium-sencha"><span class="rel-img"><img src="/images/shop/premium-sencha-80g.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="rel-name">Premium sencha</span><span class="rel-price">$24.50</span></a><a class="rel-card" href="/products/gyokuro"><span class="rel-img"><img src="/images/shop/gyokuro-30g.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="rel-name">Gyokuro</span><span class="rel-price">Out of stock</span></a><a class="rel-card" href="/products/ceremonial-matcha"><span class="rel-img"><img src="/images/shop/ceremonial-matcha-30g.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="rel-name">Ceremonial Matcha 30g</span><span class="rel-price">$25.00</span></a></div>
    <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:36px"><a class="btn-explore" href="/shop-tea">All tea</a></p></div></section>
  
  
<script is:inline>window.PDP = {"name": "Fukamushi Genmaicha", "optname": "Format", "variants": [{"id": "fukamushi-genmaicha-loose-tea-80g", "label": "Loose tea 80g", "price": 19.8, "was": null, "soldout": false, "img": "/images/shop/fukamushi-genmaicha-80g.jpg", "imgs": ["/images/shop/fukamushi-genmaicha-80g.jpg", "/images/shop/fukamushi-genmaicha-80g-hover.jpg"], "name": "Fukamushi Genmaicha", "variant": "Loose tea 80g"}, {"id": "fukamushi-genmaicha-tea-bags", "label": "Tea bags", "price": 22.0, "was": null, "soldout": false, "img": "/images/shop/fukamushi-genmaicha-bags.jpg", "imgs": ["/images/shop/fukamushi-genmaicha-bags.jpg", "/images/shop/fukamushi-genmaicha-bags-hover.jpg"], "name": "Fukamushi Genmaicha", "variant": "Tea bags"}]};</script>
<script is:inline src="/pdp.js"></script>
</SiteLayout>
